}}'''Popsicle''' is a [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 1,600 [[Beach Balls (currency)|Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} during the [[Summer Event 2023]]. It is now only available through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. It's blade is split into three sections of red, green and blue colour with the shape of the knife on the inside, resembling a popsicle lolly. Its guard and handle are brown.

